==English==

===Etymology===
A {{calque|en|de|Silberhochzeit|nocap=1}}, {{m|de|silberne Hochzeit}}, first attested 1845.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[silver anniversary]] of a [[wedding]], the [[25]][[-th|th]] [[anniversary]] of a [[marriage]].
#* '''1845''', Arthur Hugh Clough, ''Ambarvalia: Poems'', London: Chapman and Hall [1849], p 28:
#*: The '''Silver Wedding'''! on some pensive ear<br>From towers remote as sound the silvery bells,<br>To-day from one far unforgotten year<br>A silvery faint memorial music swells.

